      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It's a bug I've saw with a couple a friends too, they were marked as \"Android\" and yet being on PC.\n\nIt's a pretty old issue, I have the same problem when I switch from a Quest to PC, I still get the \"Quest\" tag in the nameplate for a couple of minutes.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
      "__v": 0,
      "_id": "659a8a686b8a1050dce54726",
      "aiGenerated": false,
